 and Git\n  status             none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command\n  lint               none\n  transition         changes lifecycle status and derived state\n  rebuild-state      rewrites deterministic tasks/_state.yaml\n  archive            moves root done/parked tasks under the task-state lock and refreshes derived state\n  backup             writes a timestamped backlog archive to the selected destination\n  metrics            none\n  conformance        self-test uses disposable fixtures only\n  executor           reference L2 executor; transitions, executes, accepts, or parks one supplied task\n  agent-context      none\n  completion         none\n  doctor             none\n  version            none\n  help               none\n  decompose          Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation.\n  recipe             Inspect and validate resolved bounded execution guidance.\n  guide              Read version-matched installed workflow guidance.\n\nUse taskspec help <command>, taskspec guide <topic>, or taskspec agent-context.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
